</code></pre> <p>What the plugin does:</p> <ul> <li>Passes <code>-Alarkbatis.mapperDir=&lt;dirs&gt;</code> to <code>compileJava</code> (defaults to <code>src/main/resources</code>; it only parses XML files whose root element is <code>&lt;mapper&gt;</code>, ignoring other XML files).</li> <li>Registers mapper XML files as task inputs for <code>compileJava</code>, so editing XML triggers recompilation.</li> <li>Adds <code>io.github.larkbatis:larkbatis-processor</code> to <code>annotationProcessor</code>.</li> </ul> Configuration<pre><code>larkbatis {
    mapperDir = layout.projectDirectory.dir("src/main/mappers")
    mapperDirs.from("src/main/legacy-mappers")   // add as many extra directories as needed
    addProcessorDependency = false               // manage processor version manually
    addParametersFlag = false                    // disable automatic -parameters flag (requires @Param on all parameters)
}
</code></pre> <p>It also registers the <code>larkbatisScan</code> task to generate a migration report:</p> <pre><code>./gradlew larkbatisScan
./gradlew larkbatisScan --args="--summary src/main"
</code></pre>

